==Battleground==
*6 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*4 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 29.33 seconds<sup>880f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**20 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**90 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
At this stage, you should primarily focus on J.K. Bun Bun, while also keeping an eye out for troublesome spam enemies like Doge Darks. Cats with abilities vs [[Red]] and [[Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies, such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]], or [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] will be very useful. For [[Dark]] enemies, consider bringing units like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]. additionally, any cats with powerful Wave Attack, such as [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]], will prove incredibly effective. Rain D. doesn't pose too much of a threat at this stage and can be taken down alongside J.K. Bun Bun.

